      "description": "Experienced Software Configuration Management Professional with 33 years in the IT industry, specializing in ENDEVOR administration and processing. Demonstrates exceptional technical and analytical skills, troubleshooting abilities, and proficiency in mainframe tools and technologies. Adept at documentation, communication, and collaboration with a strong focus on maintaining software configuration management standards. Skilled in handling various tasks such as release support, DB2 captures/loads/resumes, SOX audits, CICS research/resolution, environment setup/support, and Cloudframe support. Well-versed in providing on-call support, implementing scheduled maintenance, and ensuring data security and privacy. Proven track record of effectively managing production releases, supporting business projects, and achieving operational excellence.",
